<div id="divMainContent" class="col-md-8">

<h1 class="gutter-top" style="-ms-word-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word;">
  Personal Webpage Responsibility Acknowledgement
</h1>

<div id="ctl00_ctl00_cpContent_cpContent_divTags">
  <span class="sr-only">Tags</span>
  <span class="fa-solid fa-tags gray gutter-right-sm" aria-hidden="true" title="Tags"></span>
  
      <a href="/TDClient/30/Portal/KB/Search?SearchText=%2523personal-webpage" id="ctl00_ctl00_cpContent_cpContent_rptTags_ctl00_TagControl1_lnkDisplay" title="personal-webpage">personal-webpage</a>

    
</div>



<div id="ctl00_ctl00_cpContent_cpContent_divBody" class="gutter-top break-word ckeShim clearfix"><h2>Context</h2>

<p>

</p>

<p>In order to publish or maintain a personal webpage, and in addition to the technical requirements described in&nbsp;<a href="https://atlas.utdallas.edu/TDClient/30/Portal/KB/ArticleDet?ID=11" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Article - How to Setup Your Home Page (Personal Webpage)</a>, each user must acknowledge their personal responsibility for the compliance and upkeep of their personal webpage. Users provide this acknowledgement through the designated&nbsp;<a href="https://forms.cloud.microsoft/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=HR0ojU2c90uxbgMtFd6fbKQzebpsRM9Bi-8k1R8zW99UNTBSWUVET0VNTDQ3Nk1OVDJHSFZHVkVLTS4u" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Microsoft Forms</a>&nbsp;process.</p>

<h2>Scope</h2>

<p>

</p>

<p>This acknowledgement applies to all faculty, staff, and students who create and manage personal webpages on the University of Texas at Dallas network or using its resources.</p>

<h3>Content Responsibility</h3>

<p>By publishing or maintaining a personal webpage, users acknowledge that they are solely responsible for all content they post. This includes ensuring information is accurate, up-to-date, and relevant. Users further acknowledge that they must not publish content that is illegal, offensive, or in violation of University of Texas at Dallas policies, including but not limited to those concerning harassment, discrimination, and intellectual property.</p>

<h3>Accessibility</h3>

<p>

</p>

<p>By publishing or maintaining a personal webpage, users acknowledge that they are solely responsible for all content they post. This includes ensuring information is accurate, up-to-date, and relevant. Users further acknowledge that they must not publish content that is illegal, offensive, or in violation of University of Texas at Dallas policies, including but not limited to those concerning harassment, discrimination, and intellectual property.</p>

<h3>Privacy and Security</h3>

<p>Users acknowledge that they must protect individuals’ privacy by not disclosing personal information without consent. Users also acknowledge the need to implement reasonable security measures to protect their webpages from unauthorized access or cyber threats.</p>

<h3>Compliance</h3>

<p>

</p>

<p>

</p>

<p>Users acknowledge their obligation to comply with all applicable laws, regulations, and university policies when creating and maintaining their personal webpages. The University of Texas at Dallas reserves the right to review and remove content that violates these requirements.</p>

<h3>Accountability</h3>

<p>

</p>

<p>Users acknowledge that they are accountable for any consequences resulting from the content they publish. Users should regularly review and update their webpages to ensure ongoing compliance with these responsibilities.</p>

<h2>Enforcement</h2>

<p>

</p>

<p>Failure to uphold the responsibilities acknowledged in this document may result in the removal of the personal webpage.</p>
</div>

